    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Matĩĩna ma Rũgendo rwa Isiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maya nĩmo matĩĩna ma rũgendo rwa andũ a Isiraeli rĩrĩa moimire bũrũri wa Misiri marĩ ikundi matongoretio nĩ Musa na Harũni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nĩandĩkire matĩĩna ma rũgendo rwao o ta ũrĩa aathĩtwo nĩ Jehova. Maya nĩmo matĩĩna ma rũgendo rwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andũ a Isiraeli moimagarire kuuma Ramesese mũthenya wa ikũmi na ĩtano mweri wa mbere, mũthenya ũrĩa warũmĩrĩire Bathaka. Makiumagara momĩrĩirie, makĩonagwo nĩ andũ othe a Misiri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arĩa maathikaga marigithathi mao mothe, marĩa Jehova ooragĩte gatagatĩ kao; nĩgũkorwo Jehova nĩatuĩrĩire ngai ciao ciira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andũ a Isiraeli moima Ramesese, maambire hema Sukothu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Sukothu, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Ethamu, ndeere-inĩ cia werũ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Ethamu, maacookire na thuutha magĩthiĩ Pi-Hahirothu, mwena wa irathĩro wa Baali-Zefoni, makĩamba hema ciao hakuhĩ na Migidoli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Pi-Hahirothu, magĩtuĩkanĩria iria-inĩ gatagatĩ, magĩkinya werũ-inĩ, na maarĩkia gũthiĩ rũgendo rwa mĩthenya ĩtatũ werũ-inĩ ũcio wa Ethamu, makĩamba hema ciao Mara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Mara maathiire Elimu, kũrĩa kwarĩ na ithima ikũmi na igĩrĩ, na mĩtende mĩrongo mũgwanja, na makĩamba hema kuo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Elimu magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao hakuhĩ na Iria Itune.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Iria Itune, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao werũ-inĩ wa Sini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima werũ ũcio wa Sini, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Dofika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Dofika, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Alushu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Alushu, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Refidimu, handũ hataarĩ na maaĩ ma kũnyuuo nĩ andũ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Refidimu, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Werũ-inĩ wa Sinai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima kũu Werũ-inĩ wa Sinai, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Kibirothu-Hataava.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Kibirothu-Hataava magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Hazerothu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Hazerothu, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Rithima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Rithima, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Rimoni-Perezu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Rimoni-Perezu magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Libina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Libina, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Risa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Risa, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Kahelatha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Kahelatha, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Kĩrĩma-inĩ gĩa Sheferu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Kĩrĩma-inĩ gĩa Sheferu, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Harada.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Harada, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Makelothu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Makelothu magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Tahathu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Tahathu, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Tera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Tera, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Mithika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Mithika, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Hashimona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Hashimona, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Moserothu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Moserothu, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Bene-Jaakani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Bene-Jaakani, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Horu-Hagidigadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Horu-Hagidigadi, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Jotibatha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Jotibatha, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Abirona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Abirona, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Ezioni-Geberi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moima Ezioni-Geberi, magĩthiĩ makĩamba hema ciao Kadeshi, Werũ-inĩ wa Zini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
